 "comments": [
  {
   "address": 11876,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Relocated entry $2E68 and body length $0144 for CI."
  },
  {
   "address": 11880,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Executable entry returns immediately. The selector reads the relocated address words following this byte as data."
  },
  {
   "address": 11881,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Tagged address records used through the CI base at $06-$07. The code selects one of five three-byte records at $30B5, then uses two six-byte-per-car groups for the bitmap lists at $3163 and $325F."
  },
  {
   "address": 11959,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Bytes addressed by the final descriptor at $2EB4. The selector reads car-specific pairs using the pointer loaded at $31DA."
  },
  {
   "address": 11970,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Five groups of selected asset suffixes. The selector's loop skips zero entries and exits on $FF. Each group contains the car-specific short attribute and bitmap lists referenced by the preceding address records."
  },
  {
   "address": 12204,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Relocated entry $2FB0 and body length $0713 for TS."
  },
  {
   "address": 12208,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Reset the input latch, install the temporary IRQ, locate the graphic and car descriptions, and initialize selection to car zero."
  },
  {
   "address": 12318,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Derive the disk item suffix from the selection at $40 plus ASCII '1'. Invoke GP and DP to prepare the selected car and wait for selector input."
  },
  {
   "address": 12375,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Check the confirmation latch at $46, otherwise use the joystick index at $E2 and the table at $36B1. Advance or decrement $40 and wrap within five entries."
  },
  {
   "address": 12432,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Stop the selector music through $6400 and release the car-select assets. Read the selected car's records through the module base $06 before preparing the driving display."
  },
  {
   "address": 12561,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Copy 32 pages between the bitmap buffers selected by $34 and $35. Invoke the graphics loader and look up the car-specific assets by the selected car's suffix."
  },
  {
   "address": 13007,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Synchronize the $D418 writes with the counter at $30 and lower the volume from 12 to zero."
  },
  {
   "address": 13259,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Enable I/O, acknowledge the VIC-II interrupt, select the next raster phase and update horizontal scroll. At phase zero, service bank changes, selector joystick input and music."
  },
  {
   "address": 13417,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Find the active-low direction nibble in the table at $36BA and put its index in $E2. OR an active fire button into the confirmation latch at $46."
  },
  {
   "address": 13596,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Work with the selected offset and the visible bitmap addresses computed from the row and column tables."
  },
  {
